          <a class="row-card__heading glue-link" href=https://research.google/pubs/unified-management-system-for-a-hybrid-workforce-of-human-and-computational-agents/ >
            
              Unified Management System for a Hybrid Workforce of Human and Computational Agents
            
          </a>
        
        <div class="row-card__subheading">
          
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__item small-text">
                      
                        <a class="row-card__small-link" href="/people/tanmaykayande/">
                          Tanmay Kayande
                        </a>
                      
                    </div>
                
              
            
          
          
          <div class="row-card__subheading__spacer"></div>
